# Optional overrides (defaults are set on variables for vpc_cidr / single_nat_gateway).
# Plan/apply:
#   terraform plan -var-file=../../env/dev.core.tfvars -var-file=dev.tfvars
#
# If you omit this file entirely, pass only dev.core.tfvars (overrides then use variable defaults).

